			"File": [
				"⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				66,
				4
			],
			"Message": "feat(Maintain): Add multi-profile build support for Mountain, Electron, and compiler variants\n\nAdd CLI flags and build logic to support distinct workbench profiles and compiler variants that don't collide on disk:\n\n- Add `--Mountain` and `--Electron` flags for profile selection, each appending a unique suffix to the product name (`MountainProfile`, `ElectronProfile`) so parallel debug builds stay separated.\n- Add `--Compiler` flag (e.g., \"Rest\") to distinguish the OXC bundler path from the default TypeScript compiler.\n- Add `--CargoFeatures` to forward tier-gated Rust features to Cargo during `pnpm tauri build` via `--features <list>`.\n- Add `--CocoonEsbuildDefine` to pass tier replacement tokens to Cocoon's esbuild step.\n\nThe implementation adds observability logging for tier fan-out and re-asserts environment variables on child processes to survive potential `.env_clear()` calls.",
			"SHA": "214ce635e1a580df9ad57a215a43a2aa20368373"
		},
